  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Harbour",
    "overview": "Harbour is clear and composed: deep blue actions, misty backgrounds and pale blue supporting surfaces. Authentic wedding photography and an editorial serif supply warmth; the workspace stays readable and efficient with system typography.\n\nThis is a record of the implemented marketing and workspace milestone, not a claim of complete MVP delivery. Couple websites and invitation designs keep their chosen template palettes.",
